Package: barmbu
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, squashfs-tools
Recommends: fex-emu, erofs-utils
Suggests: flatpak
Maintainer: amruthwo <amruthwo@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/amruthwo/barmbu
Description: Run Bambu Studio's official network plugin on ARM64 Linux
 A small app (window + command line) that gets Bambu Lab's official network
 plugin working on ARM64 Linux. Bambu only builds the plugin for x86_64, so on
 ARM64 the app sets up an x86_64 copy of Bambu Studio under FEX-Emu and
 installs the official plugin inside it. On x86_64 it just installs the
 plugin.
 .
 It uses Bambu's unmodified plugin, which signs in with its own built-in
 credentials. The automatic WebKit add-on needs a Fedora-based FEX root
 filesystem and dnf.
